        "zh": "南极洲是地球上最寒冷、最干燥、风速最大的大洲，被厚达2公里的冰盖覆盖，储存着全球约70%的淡水。这片土地没有原住民，仅有各国科研站的少量研究人员常驻，是地球上最后一片未被人类开发的大陆。",
        "en": "Antarctica is Earth's coldest, driest and windiest continent, blanketed by an ice sheet up to 2 km thick that holds ~70% of the world's fresh water. With no indigenous population and only scientific researchers, it remains the last great wilderness on Earth."
